OL,3,GNEWSACouncil pays out #60k over
OL,4,Aincorrect parking fines
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Surrey council has paid out more than
OL,7,F#60,000 in refunds for parking fines
OL,8,Fissued by mistake over a six-year
OL,9,Fperiod.
OL,11,FElmbridge Borough Council launched a
OL,12,Frefund scheme in June after thousands
OL,13,Fof parking tickets were incorrectly
OL,14,Fissued in several of its car parks.
OL,16,FMore than 1,800 claims had been filed
OL,17,Fwith the local authority, with the
OL,18,Foverwhelming majority of these either
OL,19,Fpaid out or scheduled for payment, the
OL,20,FLocal Democracy Reporting Service said.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
