OL,3,GNEWSACouncil pays out #60k over
OL,4,Aincorrect parking fines
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council, which apologised for the
OL,7,Fmistake, estimated more than 9,000
OL,8,Ffines were incorrectly issued.
